/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 170 0 R
/E (Next, I'll subtract the distance covered from the initial distance to find the remaining distance from the lighthouse. The initial distance was 500 meters, so 500 - 2000 = -1500 meters. Since distance cannot be negative, this indicates that the sailor has passed the lighthouse.)
/Pg 12 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
